                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "22351213-bc99-3d0b-975b-ca667e8f7da8",
                        "entry_id": "3b69566d-9cb8-3fdc-a43d-99ee313ef8ef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "не имеющий видимой причины, основания; ничем не обусловленный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "de87edaf-d791-47ce-b97a-581d5699fb6d",
                                "sense_id": "22351213-bc99-3d0b-975b-ca667e8f7da8",
                                "text": "Ребячески неосторожный, беспричинный и неблагородный отъезд его из Африки, от товарищей в беде, ставится ему в заслугу, и опять неприятельский флот два раза упускает его."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2f373da4-3974-4e9b-9af4-d5c1e4117d53",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b69566d-9cb8-3fdc-a43d-99ee313ef8ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "22351213-bc99-3d0b-975b-ca667e8f7da8",
                        "target_lang_word": "causeless",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "causeless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1f7a26b-5aba-3fc8-9183-f07c0ce4fe16",
                                        "entry_id": "5ce9c209-8c8c-31ad-8319-463e3120716e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having no obvious cause; fortuitous or inexplicable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "596ea2bc-0324-3f5c-899e-fa25c3e74c43",
                                        "entry_id": "5ce9c209-8c8c-31ad-8319-463e3120716e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Groundless or unreasonable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51674fa3-e603-4375-9589-066dd674ff20",
                                                "sense_id": "596ea2bc-0324-3f5c-899e-fa25c3e74c43",
                                                "text": "[H]e […] by his overcarefulneſſe and cauſeleſſe ſuſpicion, deprived himſelf of this benefit, and implunged himſelf in much juſt hatred for his unjuſt dealing and treachery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c8cfa29-4d0f-445d-93e5-29f81d95e5c0",
                                                "sense_id": "596ea2bc-0324-3f5c-899e-fa25c3e74c43",
                                                "text": "Alas my fears are cauſless, and ungrounded, / Fantaſtick dreams, and melancholick fumes / Of crazy ſtomacks, and diſtempered brains: / Has this convinc'd you?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "125d998e-5fff-40f2-86fe-a6541e9ba20a",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b69566d-9cb8-3fdc-a43d-99ee313ef8ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "22351213-bc99-3d0b-975b-ca667e8f7da8",
                        "target_lang_word": "groundless",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "groundless",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4685ef6-9d6f-3b54-ae7e-7aacad4139d2",
                                        "entry_id": "4892bb27-1789-352f-96a1-1e163589fd80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without any grounds to support it; baseless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66e90edd-6e12-46b6-a10d-a46d47b2d5a5",
                                                "sense_id": "b4685ef6-9d6f-3b54-ae7e-7aacad4139d2",
                                                "text": "[B]e the consequences what they may, they shall not move an inch, nor a hair's-breadth from the ground of their groundless spiritual independence, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfaa6d30-8515-45f9-b565-0f9e55c8d2f0",
                                                "sense_id": "b4685ef6-9d6f-3b54-ae7e-7aacad4139d2",
                                                "text": "At that stage any fears among home fans of a possession monopoly by Laudrup's side were proving groundless, with Cardiff having their fair share of the ball and territory."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2bc5e8f6-6caa-42aa-aba1-64c03db0d660",
                        "source_entry_id": "3b69566d-9cb8-3fdc-a43d-99ee313ef8ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "22351213-bc99-3d0b-975b-ca667e8f7da8",
                        "target_lang_word": "grundlos",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "grundlos",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de1fd600-a81d-3822-8ae3-d64eac00cf81",
                                        "entry_id": "322b9658-f7ee-3c9c-b04f-11ff3c92243c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ohne Begründung; scheinbar ohne Ursache"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f267bcd-58fc-4c7b-b0d6-08d626357849",
                                                "sense_id": "de1fd600-a81d-3822-8ae3-d64eac00cf81",
                                                "text": "Darüber hat er sich ganz grundlos aufgeregt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddd77d83-1382-4276-b5ab-fe61b4b6713e",
                                                "sense_id": "de1fd600-a81d-3822-8ae3-d64eac00cf81",
                                                "text": "Er ist grundlos entlassen worden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0912043c-bb5a-4969-b624-b69afee79ed0",
                                                "sense_id": "de1fd600-a81d-3822-8ae3-d64eac00cf81",
                                                "text": "Der Vorgesetzte hat ihn nicht ganz grundlos heruntergeputzt."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05ef7635-efa7-3b64-8d0a-819019c2d295",
                                        "entry_id": "322b9658-f7ee-3c9c-b04f-11ff3c92243c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ohne festen Untergrund"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e95d7ed7-aafb-4165-9390-4f2110184784",
                                                "sense_id": "05ef7635-efa7-3b64-8d0a-819019c2d295",
                                                "text": "Das Fahren über grundlose Wege ist kein leichtes Unterfangen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "548b483d-d2a0-3ba7-b149-eb556df74b1b",
                                        "entry_id": "322b9658-f7ee-3c9c-b04f-11ff3c92243c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ohne Boden; so, dass der Boden weit weg liegt; sehr tief"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figurative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92ff9cb2-579c-4867-9b19-114e580d3d97",
                                                "sense_id": "548b483d-d2a0-3ba7-b149-eb556df74b1b",
                                                "text": "„Und so sollen alle Ströme der Gnade in uns in das Meer fließen, aus dem sie kamen, in das grundlose, uferlose Meer ewiger Liebe.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
